    PL42 G 4 A_Pain
    Goto Idle
  Death:
	PL42 H 8
	PL42 I 8 A_PlayerScream
	PL42 J 8 A_NoBlocking
	PL42 K 8
	PL42 L 8 A_SpawnItemEx("BodyCrash",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,SXF_CLIENTSIDE)
